sted environments in public beta</div>\n                    <div class=\"update-description\">\n                        Self-hosted environments run Claude Code cloud sessions on infrastructure your organization operates, now in public beta on Team and Enterprise plans.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-08-03</span>\n                        <span>|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\">View Release →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"update-item\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n                    <div class=\"update-title\">Auto mode becomes default</div>\n                    <div class=\"update-description\">\n                        Auto mode becomes the default permission mode for new sessions on Pro, Max, and Team plans starting August 14.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-08-03</span>\n                        <span>|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\">View Release →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"update-item\">\n                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n                    <div class=\"update-title\">Copilot memory and JetBrains features</div>\n                    <div class=\"update-description\">\n                        New Copilot memory features and Ollama integration in GitHub Copilot for JetBrains. Copilot Memory helps the assistant become more effective by remembering facts about r